{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40680","headline":"观水墨障子 · 李洞","name":"观水墨障子","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"若非神助笔，砚水恐藏龙。\n研尽一寸墨，埽成千仞峰。\n壁根堆乱石，牀罅插枯松。\n岳麓穿因鼠，湘江绽爲蛬。\n挂衣岚气湿，梦枕浪头舂。\n只爲少颜色，时人着意慵。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李洞","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_40680.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40680","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}